==Battleground==
*1 [[Shakurel Lion (Enemy)|Shakurel Lion]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Shakurel Tiger (Enemy)|Shakurel Tigers]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Shakurel Tiger (Enemy)|Shakurel Tigers]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Shakurel Tiger (Enemy)|Shakurel Tiger]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Once the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Shakurel Tiger (Enemy)|Shakurel Tigers]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Shakurel Lion (Enemy)|Shakurel Lion]] spawns.
**1 [[Shakurel Panda (Enemy)|Shakurel Panda]] spawns as the boss.


==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

